---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Umbrella Systems | The Team Behind the Screens"
  description="Meet the four-person team behind Umbrella Systems. We specialize in IT for Minnesota charter schools — embedded, proactive, and focused on getting it right."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="comic-hero">
    <div class="comic-hero-halftone"></div>
    <div class="comic-hero-inner">
      <div class="comic-hero-text animate-in">
        <h1 class="comic-h1">
          WE'RE THE <span class="highlight">TEAM</span> BEHIND THE SCREENS
        </h1>
        <p class="comic-sub">
          Umbrella Systems started with a simple idea: schools deserve IT support that actually understands them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="comic-hero-image animate-in" data-delay="1">
        <div style="display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:start;">
          <div class="comic-panel" style="transform:rotate(-2deg); flex:1;">
            <img src="/images/jesse-2.JPG" alt="Jesse Schonfeld" loading="eager" style="height:auto;" />
          </div>
          <div class="comic-panel" style="transform:rotate(1.5deg); flex:1; margin-top:40px;">
            <img src="/images/austin-headshot-1.jpg" alt="Austin VanAlstyne" loading="eager" style="height:auto;" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="comic-hero-clip"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Schools Section -->
  <section class="why-schools halftone-bg-light">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="comic-h2 animate-in">WHY SCHOOLS?</h2>
      <div class="why-schools-body animate-in" data-delay="1">
        <p>
          Most IT companies serve anyone who'll sign a contract. Law firms, dental offices, logistics companies — whoever's next in line. Schools get lumped in with the rest, and the support reflects that: generic solutions, slow response times, and technicians who've never set foot in a classroom.
        </p>
        <p>
          We built Umbrella Systems because we think that's backwards.
        </p>
        <p>
          Schools have unique challenges. Hundreds of student devices that take a beating. State-mandated testing platforms that have to work on test day. Staff who need help now, not after a ticket bounces between three people. E-Rate funding that can save tens of thousands — if someone actually does the paperwork.
        </p>
        <p>
          We focus on schools because that's what we're good at. We keep our client base small on purpose — not because we can't grow, but because we'd rather every school get real attention than spread ourselves thin chasing contracts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team Section -->
  <section class="team-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="team-header animate-in">
        <h2 class="comic-h2">MEET THE HEROES</h2>
        <p class="comic-sub-center">Four people based in the Twin Cities, with six years in the industry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <!-- Austin -->
        <div class="team-card animate-in" data-delay="0">
          <div class="team-card-photo">
            <img src="/images/austin.jpg" alt="Austin VanAlstyne" loading="lazy" style="object-position: center 25%;" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3 class="team-name">Austin VanAlstyne</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Co-Founder & Technical Lead</p>
            <p class="team-bio">Austin runs the technical side — from network architecture and cybersecurity to the systems that keep everything monitored and running. He's the one building the dashboards, writing the automation, and making sure nothing falls through the cracks.</p>
            <div class="speech-bubble-small">
              <p>"I got into this because I kept seeing schools get overcharged for mediocre IT. We can do better than that."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Jesse -->
        <div class="team-card animate-in" data-delay="1">
          <div class="team-card-photo">
            <img src="/images/jesse-1.jpg" alt="Jesse Schonfeld" loading="lazy" style="object-position: center top;" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3 class="team-name">Jesse Schonfeld</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Co-Founder & Operations Lead</p>
            <p class="team-bio">Jesse handles operations, client relationships, and business strategy. He's usually the first person a new school talks to and the one making sure the partnership stays strong long-term.</p>
            <div class="speech-bubble-small">
              <p>"The best compliment we get is when a school forgets they're outsourcing their IT."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Vinny -->
        <div class="team-card animate-in" data-delay="2">
          <div class="team-card-photo">
            <img src="/images/vinny.jpg" alt="Vinny Simon" loading="lazy" style="object-position: center 20%;" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3 class="team-name">Vinny Simon</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Field Technician</p>
            <p class="team-bio">Vinny is the one pulling cable, racking switches, and getting infrastructure projects across the finish line. He's also the person we send when a school needs extra hands fast.</p>
            <div class="speech-bubble-small">
              <p>"I like the big builds. There's something satisfying about walking out of a school knowing the infrastructure is solid for years."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Brendan -->
        <div class="team-card animate-in" data-delay="3">
          <div class="team-card-photo">
            <img src="/images/brendan-2.png" alt="Brendan VanAlstyne" loading="lazy" style="object-position: 30% 20%;" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-body">
            <h3 class="team-name">Brendan VanAlstyne</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Field Technician</p>
            <p class="team-bio">Brendan works alongside Vinny on deployment projects and infrastructure builds. Need 200 Chromebooks staged before the first day of school? That's Brendan.</p>
            <div class="speech-bubble-small">
              <p>"Give me a project list and a deadline. I'll make it happen."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work Section -->
  <section class="how-we-work">
    <div class="how-we-work-halftone"></div>
    <div class="how-we-work-clip-top"></div>
    <div class="section-inner how-we-work-inner">
      <h2 class="comic-h2 white animate-in">HOW WE WORK</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card animate-in" data-delay="0">
          <div class="stat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-value">24/7</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Network monitoring and emergency support</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in" data-delay="1">
          <div class="stat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-value">$0</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Phase 0 onboarding — we shadow first, no cost</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in" data-delay="2">
          <div class="stat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Minnesota-based team, every single person</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in" data-delay="3">
          <div class="stat-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-value">30 min</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Critical issue response time</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-we-work-clip-bottom"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Phase 0 Section -->
  <section class="phase-zero-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="phase-zero-bubble animate-in">
        <div class="speech-bubble-tail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="phase-zero-text">
          Before any contract starts, we spend time embedded with your current IT setup — learning your systems, your staff, and your pain points. No cost, no commitment. Just a chance for both sides to make sure it's the right fit.
        </p>
        <p class="phase-zero-label">This is <strong>Phase 0</strong> onboarding.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="comic-cta">
    <div class="comic-cta-halftone"></div>
    <div class="section-inner comic-cta-inner">
      <h2 class="comic-h2 white animate-in">
        SEE WHAT <span class="highlight">PHASE 0</span> LOOKS LIKE
      </h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="comic-btn animate-in" data-delay="1">Schedule a Phase 0 Tour</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bangers&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --navy: #1a1a2e;
    --red: #ff1744;
    --red-dark: #d50000;
    --yellow: #ffd600;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --gray: #9e9e9e;
    --shadow-comic: 4px 4px 0px var(--navy);
    --border-comic: 3px solid var(--navy);
  }

  /* ---- Animations ---- */
  .animate-in {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease-out, transform 0.6s ease-out;
  }
  .animate-in.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .animate-in[data-delay="1"] { transition-delay: 0.15s; }
  .animate-in[data-delay="2"] { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
  .animate-in[data-delay="3"] { transition-delay: 0.45s; }

  /* ---- Typography ---- */
  .comic-h1 {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .comic-h2 {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .comic-h2.white { color: var(--white); }
  .highlight {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--navy);
    padding: 0 0.3em;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }
  .comic-sub {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .comic-sub-center {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  /* ---- Layout helpers ---- */
  .section-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ---- Comic Panel ---- */
  .comic-panel {
    border: var(--border-comic);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-comic);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .comic-panel img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* ---- HERO ---- */
  .comic-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 250px 0 9rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .comic-hero-halftone {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 12px 12px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .comic-hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .comic-hero-inner {
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    .comic-hero-text { flex: 0 0 38%; }
    .comic-hero-image { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  }
  .comic-panel-hero {
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }
  .comic-hero-clip {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 60px;
    background: var(--white);
    clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 0);
  }

  /* ---- WHY SCHOOLS ---- */
  .why-schools {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: var(--white);
    position: relative;
  }
  .halftone-bg-light::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,26,46,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 16px 16px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .why-schools-body {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
  }
  .why-schools-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* ---- TEAM ---- */
  .team-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: #f7f7fb;
  }
  .team-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  .team-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: var(--border-comic);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-comic);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .team-card:nth-child(odd) { transform: rotate(-0.8deg); }
  .team-card:nth-child(even) { transform: rotate(0.8deg); }
  .team-card:hover { transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px); }
  .team-card-photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: var(--border-comic);
  }
  .team-card-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .team-card-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .team-name {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .team-role {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--red);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .team-bio {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .speech-bubble-small {
    background: var(--yellow);
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .speech-bubble-small p {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- HOW WE WORK ---- */
  .how-we-work {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--red);
    padding: 6rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .how-we-work-halftone {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 10px 10px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .how-we-work-clip-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 50px;
    background: #f7f7fb;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 0 100%);
  }
  .how-we-work-clip-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 50px;
    background: var(--white);
    clip-path: polygon(100% 0, 0 100%, 100% 100%);
  }
  .how-we-work-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: var(--border-comic);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-comic);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .stat-icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .stat-value {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ---- PHASE 0 ---- */
  .phase-zero-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .phase-zero-bubble {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border: var(--border-comic);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--navy);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .speech-bubble-tail {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20px;
    left: 60px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 20px solid transparent;
    border-right: 10px solid transparent;
    border-top: 22px solid var(--navy);
  }
  .speech-bubble-tail::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 3px;
    left: -17px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 18px solid transparent;
    border-right: 9px solid transparent;
    border-top: 19px solid var(--yellow);
  }
  .phase-zero-text {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .phase-zero-label {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- CTA ---- */
  .comic-cta {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .comic-cta-halftone {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 14px 14px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .comic-cta-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .comic-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--navy);
    background: var(--yellow);
    border: var(--border-comic);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-comic);
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .comic-btn:hover {
    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--navy);
  }
  .comic-btn:active {
    transform: translate(2px, 2px);
    box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--navy);
  }
</style>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('visible');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.15 }
  );
  document.querySelectorAll('.animate-in').forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
</script>
